# Source: `kubectl logs -n ate-system <atenet-router pod> -c envoy`, from the
# Envoy 1.38.4 A/B run used to test whether the atenet-router crash was an
# Envoy version regression. It was not: 1.38.4 aborts on the SAME assertion
# as the pinned 1.39.1, and 1.38.4 prints the assertion message instead of
# letting the crash handler's own dump segfault over it.
